   "prompt": "Many monatomic ions are found in seawater, including the ions formed from the following list of elements. Write the Lewis symbols for the monatomic ions formed from the following elements:<br>(a) Cl<br>(b) Na<br>(c) Mg<br>(d) Ca<br>(e) K<br>(f) Br<br>(g) Sr<br>(h) F",
